sequenceDiagram
    participant C1 as 客户端1
    participant C2 as 客户端2
    participant E as etcd集群

    C1->>E: 获取锁 /lock/resource
    E->>C1: 成功，租约ID=1

    C2->>E: 获取锁 /lock/resource
    E->>C2: 失败，锁已被占用

    Note over C1: 执行临界区操作

    C1->>E: 释放锁
    E->>C1: 成功

    C2->>E: 重试获取锁
    E->>C2: 成功，租约ID=2
